            MVC CPUP,=C' HAS BEEN UP .... DAYS .. HOURS .. MIN'         CPW07900
            SPACE 1                                                     CPW07910
            LM    R0,R1,THISCLOK                                        CPW07920
            SL    R0,CPSTART                                            CPW07930
